## The idea

ShahrAgah was a social network that connected businesses and customers. Customers could find a large number of local businesses online and share their thoughts about their shopping experiences.

## From business plan to startup

The project started as a business plan. It was first submitted to the IUT Entrepreneurship Festival, where it was awarded "best promising project". I then founded a startup, ShahrAgah, to build it, and led the team. I also worked as the software analyst and implemented the project.
